            "review_title": "Review at Vietnamese street food",
            "review_text": "randrew12\nChennai (Madras), India17 contributions\n0\nHanoi Street Food Tour - highly recommended!\nOct 2016 • Friends\nI highly recommend the HSFT to any visitors to Hanoi. The company offers several options for tours, and I advise choosing these options: walking tour, during the evening, in a group. My wife, our friend, and I had a great time seeing the city at night, trying all the different food -- it was all delicious and several of the places we went to were places that we would never had gone to on our own. We also had fun meeting the other people on the tour. Our guide was \"Kiwi\" -- a local college-aged woman who was simply great. She was enthusiastic, confident, and knowledgeable. She expertise included her ability to describe the food, tell us about parts of the city, and she communicated clearly in English. We were all quite impressed with her and recommend that if you book a tour with HSFT you should be sure to request her as your guide. The tour was the highlight of our week in Hanoi.\nRead more\nWritten October 7, 2016",
